 "title": "Commodity Meats | Cooper Farms Inc.",
 "text": "Commodity Meats | Cooper Farms Inc.\nSkip to Content\nIMPORTANT HEALTH COVERAGE TAX DOCUMENTS:\nDue to regulatory compliance changes, employers are no longer required to automatically furbish Form 1095-C tax documents to their employees. If you wish to receive a copy of your Form 1095-C, please reach out to the HR Operations department using the following contact information:\nE-mail: BenefitAdmin@cooperfarms.com\nPhone: 419-375-4116 Ext. 1029\nSearch\nCareers\nGrain\nContact\nProducts\nDeli Meats\nSliced Meats\nTurkey Burgers\nCommodity Meats\nEggs\nPet Food Ingredients\nView All Products\nInterested in Our Products?\nContact Sales\nFarmers\nOur Farmers\nGrower Interest Form\nGrow With Cooper Farms\nContact Us\nResponsibility\nAnimal Care\nEnvironment\nFood Safety & Quality\nWe care\nAnimal Care\nCommunity\nScholarships\nDonation Request Form\nWe Give Back\nCommunity\nCompany\nHistory\nFamily\nBeliefs\nLocations\nNews\nDirectory\nCelebrating Our 85th Anniversary\nResources\nNews\nPublications\nRecipes\nFAQs\nBuilt on Culture\nLearn More About Us\nCareers\nGrain\nContact\nCommodity Meats\nCommodity Meats\nA Variety of Options\nWe provide a variety of commodity turkey products both conventional and NAE for domestic and export customers. Our fresh products that are packed in combo bins consist of: tenders, scapula, wing meat, drums, necks, tails, thigh meat. We also provide a number of fresh ground products including:\nGround Breast Trim\nGround Thigh Trim\nGround Drum\nGround Neck\nInterested in Our Products?\nWhether you are ready to make an order or want more information, our sales team is happy to help!\nContact Sales\nProducts\nFarmers\nResponsibility\nCommunity\nCompany\nResources\nContact Sales\nTeam Member Referral\nInsurance Benefits\nPay Benefits\nAdditional Benefits\nApp Resources\nContact\n22348 Rd 140, Oakwood, OH 45873\nOakwood,\nOH\n45873\n419-594-3325\nPrivacy Policy\n© 2026 Cooper Farms Inc. All Rights Reserved.\n/",
